:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Squid (Special Cat)]].''
'''Squid''' (いか, ''ika'') is an [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]] and [[Summer Break Cats (Gauntlet)|Summer Break Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Squid
|image = E 155.png
|appearance = [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Summer Break Cats (Gauntlet)|Summer Break Cats]]
|money drop = 25¢ - 98¢
}}

==Enemy==
Squid is a small enemy that is usually spammed. In large numbers, Squid can cause significant damage to your higher troops or cat base; however, despite its strength in numbers, it is rather weak when on its own or when exposed to cats with Area Attack.

==Strategy==
Use anything to defeat it and it will most likely die in one hit regardless.

